      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_8b09e618",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: morgan_freeman_played_god_in_bruce_almighty; hasOverallIntent: Harmful; overall-intent-description: The image shows a photo of actor Morgan Freeman with the text 'morgan freeman played god in bruce almighty'. The overall intent is to humorously or ironically reference his role in the film, where he portrays God. While not inherently abusive or hateful, the meme's intent is to reduce a respected actor to a comedic or trivialized role, potentially diminishing the seriousness of his performance or the film's themes. This can be considered harmful as it may contribute to a culture of trivializing serious roles or public figures, especially if used in contexts that mock or belittle the actor's stature or the film's message. The meme does not contain explicit toxicity targeting protected characteristics, but its effect can be seen as dismissive or disrespectful toward the actor's work, which may be perceived as harmful by some audiences.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_a9bbc38b"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
