      "description": "The text 'morgan freeman played god in bruce almighty' explicitly maps the visual entity Morgan_Freeman onto the role of God from the film Bruce Almighty. The meme uses the actor's image to represent his portrayal of the divine character, creating an analogical mapping between the visual entity (Morgan_Freeman) and the textual role (God).",
